  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">재과만 고수님들의 게시글을 도움 받아<br>&#160;<br>클로드를 활용하여<br>저도 처음으로 전사과정 시뮬레이션 앱을 만들었습니다~<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">입력한 교과서 내용</span></b></td><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">프롬프트</span></b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: justify;\"><br><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/871f5d0cdf41b1d09ab000af8ae6caea200b451c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/871f5d0cdf41b1d09ab000af8ae6caea200b451c\" data-origin-width=\"622\" data-origin-height=\"730\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 50.0%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #0B0B0B;\">전사과정을 학습할 수 있는 상호작용 시뮬레이션 앱을 만들어.</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">앱주소 :<br><a href=\"https://claude.ai/artifact/7u9Jw49ay1E8st2PnGw5tc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://claude.ai/artifact/7u9Jw49ay1E8st2PnGw5tc</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"RNA 전사 시뮬레이터\" data-og-description=\"RNA 중합 효소의 결합부터 RNA 분리까지 전사의 개시·신장·종결을 단계별로 관찰하고, 직접 RNA를 합성하며 서열 변환과 퀴즈로 복습하는 학습 앱.\" data-og-host=\"claude.ai\" data-og-source-url=\"https://claude.ai/artifact/7u9Jw49ay1E8st2PnGw5tc\" data-og-url=\"https://claude.ai/artifact/7u9Jw49ay1E8st2PnGw5tc\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/blWfGn/dJMb9aK1SMT/sDIDylPi1hj260k0JuhSGK/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/qIJbC/dJMb9aK1SMS/eKkygjh3UVBByr4V7FhTSK/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\"><a href=\"https://claude.ai/artifact/7u9Jw49ay1E8st2PnGw5tc\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://claude.ai/artifact/7u9Jw49ay1E8st2PnGw5tc\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/blWfGn/dJMb9aK1SMT/sDIDylPi1hj260k0JuhSGK/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/qIJbC/dJMb9aK1SMS/eKkygjh3UVBByr4V7FhTSK/img.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">RNA 전사 시뮬레이터</p><p class=\"og-desc\">RNA 중합 효소의 결합부터 RNA 분리까지 전사의 개시·신장·종결을 단계별로 관찰하고, 직접 RNA를 합성하며 서열 변환과 퀴즈로 복습하는 학습 앱.</p><p class=\"og-host\">claude.ai</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">&lt;이 앱을 자신에게 맞게 수정하는 방법&gt;</span></b><br>1. 화면 우측 상단에 &#39;공유&#39;를 클릭<br>&#160;<br>2. &#39;복제&#39;를 클릭</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/551b9a3bea4735e4192534e3881b6f63904337d5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/551b9a3bea4735e4192534e3881b6f63904337d5\" data-origin-width=\"460\" data-origin-height=\"221\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">3. &#39;채팅시작&#39; 클릭</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5df1cf046e380db0d64942f0a9cf2e7e528a11a3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5df1cf046e380db0d64942f0a9cf2e7e528a11a3\" data-origin-width=\"277\" data-origin-height=\"65\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">4. 클로드가 실행되고, 좌측 하단의 대화창에 수정하고 싶은 내용 입력</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/be263cdbd5c8814871ce384759b24901f777c289\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"584\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/be263cdbd5c8814871ce384759b24901f777c289\" data-origin-width=\"1196\" data-origin-height=\"805\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">5. 수정이 되면 우측상단의 &#39;내보내기&#39; 버튼 클릭 - &#39;HTML&#39; 클릭&#160;&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f18a1f29fddebaca201d627bb95ff937911ddcd5\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"285\" height=\"186\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f18a1f29fddebaca201d627bb95ff937911ddcd5\" data-origin-width=\"488\" data-origin-height=\"319\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>6. 내 컴퓨터의 &#39;다운로드&#39; 폴더에 &#39;파일&#39;이 생성 --&gt; 파일명을 index.html로 변경하기&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b60fe81902d9ba79ee9577e5efc9d6164e58cf1a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b60fe81902d9ba79ee9577e5efc9d6164e58cf1a\" data-origin-width=\"439\" data-origin-height=\"179\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">7. github.com을 접속하여 배포 주소 만들기<br><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/445\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/445</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"여기를 눌러 링크를 확인하세요\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/445\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=evuJ&amp;datanum=445\" data-og-image=\"https://img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafe_image/cafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/445\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/445\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafe_image/cafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\">여기를 눌러 링크를 확인하세요</p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/448?svc=cafeapp\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/448?svc=cafeapp</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Github-선생님께서 만드신 프로그램을 인터넷에 공개하는 방법(매우 친절한 매뉴얼)\" data-og-description=\"&#160;https://scienceisjo.github.io/githubmanual/forstudent.html&#160;안녕하세요! 요즘 선생님들께서 웹앱을 직접 만드시고 감사하게도 공유해주셔서 제가 약한 생물 파트웹앱을 곳간에 많이 보관하고 있습니다.&#160;인\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/448?svc=cafeapp\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/448?svc=cafeapp\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dFIPVL/dJMb87OkiBx/UQ7SKtBVMnSaeQVHvBY5E1/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=151&amp;height=151\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/448?svc=cafeapp\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/448?svc=cafeapp\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dFIPVL/dJMb87OkiBx/UQ7SKtBVMnSaeQVHvBY5E1/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=151&amp;height=151\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Github-선생님께서 만드신 프로그램을 인터넷에 공개하는 방법(매우 친절한 매뉴얼)</p><p class=\"og-desc\">&#160;https://scienceisjo.github.io/githubmanual/forstudent.html&#160;안녕하세요! 요즘 선생님들께서 웹앱을 직접 만드시고 감사하게도 공유해주셔서 제가 약한 생물 파트웹앱을 곳간에 많이 보관하고 있습니다.&#160;인</p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br>&#160;<br>8. 배포주소 완성!<br><b>github.com</b> 를 이용한 배포 주소 :&#160;<br><a href=\"https://sedu21.github.io/replication1/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sedu21.github.io/replication1/</a></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
